          "comment": "[Playbook] We limited automatic renewals to twelve months and shortened the non-renewal notice window to thirty days, since a renewal term equal to a potentially multi-year prior term plus a 90-day window makes exit impractical. We also added a 60-day renewal reminder and capped renewal uplift at the lesser of CPI and 3% so renewal pricing is predictable; a 60-day window with uplift capped at 5% would also work for us.",
