              "oldText": "at least ninety (90) days prior",
              "newText": "at least thirty (30) days prior"
            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0040",
              "text": "IBM will notify Customer in writing of the upcoming renewal at least sixty (60) days prior to the end of the then-current term. Any increase in Charges for a renewal term will not exceed the lesser of (i) the increase in the U.S. Consumer Price Index over the preceding twelve (12) months and (ii) three percent (3%)."
